  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1293B"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is50">
        <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e98">Caput 50</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_1@1-5">Haec dicit Dominus: Quis est?</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is50-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e113">Post vocationem gentium, post captionem fortis, <pb ed="#P" n="1293C"/> cujus praeda divisa est apostolis, loquitur ad populum Judaeorum super Sion quae superius ait: <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e117" source="http://scta.info/resource/is49_14@4-6">Dereliquit me Dominus,</quote> etc.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e122">
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e124" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/is50_1@1-5"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e126" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom7_14@7-13">Vendidi. Ego autem carnalis sum venundatus sub peccato</quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e129" source="http://scta.info/resource/io8_34@10-15">Qui facit peccatum servus peccati est</quote>. Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e132" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom6_12@1-6">Non regnet peccatum in corpore vestro</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e137">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e139">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e141">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_2@1-2">Quia veni.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e146"><name xml:id="gom-is50-Nd1e147" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e150">Hoc est ut sciatis me matrem vestram non repudiasse, sed eam voluntate propria recessisse: post multa beneficia carnem assumpsi, nec jam per prophetas, sed praesens ipse locutus sum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e153">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e155" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_2@4-6">Non erat vir.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e158"><seg type="qs">Herodi propter malitiam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de omnibus in commune: <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e164" source="http://scta.info/resource/is30">Visio quadrupedum in deserto<!-- check: cited chapter given; verse not identified --></quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_2@7-7">Vocavi.</quote>
            Quasi diceret: Rationales, <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e174" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps77_1@9-15">Inclinate aurem vestram in verba oris mei</quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e177" source="http://scta.info/resource/io8_14@18-22">Qui sitit, veniat et bibat</quote>, et hujusmodi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e181">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e183" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_2@13-13">Nunquid.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e186"><name xml:id="gom-is50-Nd1e187" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e190">Invehitur contra eos qui putabant, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e192" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt26_53@10-17">usque ad ut exhibeat mihi plus quam duodecim legiones angelorum?</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e198">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e200">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e202">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e204" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_3@1-3">Induam coelos tenebris.</quote>
            Aiunt philosophi non amplius decem stadiis a terra nubes in sublime levari, et solis splendorem abscondi: sic excluso coeli lumine, aer inferior obscuratur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e208">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_3@1-1">Induam.</quote>
            Sanctos, scilicet ut se cognoscant peccatores.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_3@4-6">Et saccum ponam.</quote>
            Ut agant poenitentiam in timore et cilicio.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e221">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e223">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e225">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1294A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e229" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_4@1-2">Dominus dedit,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e232"><name xml:id="gom-is50-Nd1e233" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e236">Quamvis possint haec referri ad Isaiam, proprie tamen referuntur ad Christum, quasi diceret: Qui olim talia operatus sum, et modo similia operari possum, non est potentia imminuta.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e241">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e243">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e245">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e247" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_9@13-14">Quasi vestimentum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is50-Rd1e250"><name xml:id="gom-is50-Nd1e251" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e254">Vestimentum vetustate et tinea consumitur. Judaei quoque quadraginta duobus annis post passionem ad poenitentiam vocati sunt: tandem negligentes contriti sunt advenientibus Romanis, et malae conscientiae tinea devorati.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e258">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e260">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e262">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e264" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_10@1-3">Quis ex vobis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e267"><seg type="qs">Qui timet non est perfectus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hic custodit animas sanctorum integras et pudicas et puras.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e275">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e277" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_10@10-13">Qui ambulavit in tenebris.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e280"><seg type="qs">Gentilis populus in tenebris</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ad poenitentiam voco; <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e286" source="http://scta.info/resource/ez18_23@12-18">nolo <pb ed="#P" n="1294B"/> enim mortem peccatoris, sed magis ut convertatur et vivat</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is50-Dd1e294">
          <head xml:id="gom-is50-Hd1e296">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e298">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e300" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_11@1-2">Ecce omnes,</quote>
            quasi diceret: Nihil prodest exhortatio, nec est spes salutis post scelera: <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e303" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps13_3@1-6">Omnes declinaverunt simul inutiles facti sunt</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e307">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e309" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_11@4-5">Accendentes ignem.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e312"><seg type="qs">Civitatis ignem quo a Romanis succensa est accenderunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic peccatoribus diversa peccati materia plus vel minus succenditur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is50-d1e320">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e322" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is50_11@25-27">In doloribus dormietis.</quote>
            Quia nec beneficiis, nec tormentis, Dei Filium suscipere voluerunt, unde, <quote xml:id="gom-is50-Qd1e325" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt25_41@12-15">Ite, maledicti, in ignem aeternum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
